MP6 Unlocked FPS: make replay begin decline on a full render-worker queue.

Patch 0022 made frame-slot and mapped-staging admission nonblocking, but the
last step of begin_frame still used BoundedQueue::push, which waits when the
render-worker queue is full.  Add a try-push surface and roll back the otherwise
unobserved frame packet when that final admission step fails.  The normal game
frame path retains its blocking queue behavior.

